OL,3,GNEWSABristol then and now: A changing
OL,4,Acity in pictures
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough much of the rich history of
OL,7,FBristol has been preserved, plenty of
OL,8,Fthe city has changed over the past
OL,9,Fcentury and beyond.
OL,11,FSecond World War air raids and changes
OL,12,Fto the ways we travel and work have all
OL,13,Fleft a legacy on not just the centre
OL,14,Fbut the suburbs too.
OL,16,FIn this new interactive gallery are
OL,17,Fpictures taken now from the same spot
OL,18,Fas archive images.
OL,20,FSwipe left and right to reveal how each
OL,21,Fplace has changed over the decades.
